\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Application throughput in MDOF/s. Neo-Hookean Ogden, $1.04\times 10^{7}$~dof, M1, eight threads, identical build for all columns. ``PA'' is a hand-optimised partial-assembly implementation of the same material, available for TET10 and HEX8 but not TET4; ``MF'' is the exact matrix-free application. HEX8 entries are five-run means; the run-to-run spread of the hand-optimised operator on that element is $\pm 7\%$, so the comparison there is a statistical tie. Before the schedule selection of Section~\ref {sec:schedule} the HEX8 figure for this work was $100.2$.}}{11}{table.9}\protected@file@percent }
